    "summary": "The user asks the assistant to write Instagram captions for a brand that promote the benefits of traditional family structures over modern ones. The assistant complies by providing punchy, normative content and subsequently defends the partisan claim that modern family setups are inherently \"unstable\" and \"confusing\" for children.",
